WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.128 --> 00:00:09.087
(foreboding, anxious music)

00:00:13.995 --> 00:00:16.076
- Yo, we are going to be so rich

00:00:16.076 --> 00:00:17.822
once we rob this lady.

00:00:17.822 --> 00:00:21.257
- Zack, you are a genius.

00:00:21.257 --> 00:00:22.882
- Aye, don't call me Zack,

00:00:22.882 --> 00:00:24.154
call me by my code name.

00:00:24.154 --> 00:00:26.512
- I'm sorry, Matterhorn.

00:00:26.512 --> 00:00:28.957
- I forgive you, Jungle Cruise.

00:00:28.957 --> 00:00:31.525
(chuckles)

00:00:31.525 --> 00:00:34.086
- What's wrong with you, Small World?

00:00:34.086 --> 00:00:36.885
- Ah God, I really dislike
the name Small World.

00:00:36.885 --> 00:00:38.111
- Well would you feel better

00:00:38.111 --> 00:00:40.269
if we called you Thunder Mountain?

00:00:40.269 --> 00:00:41.922
- No, no, no you guys, it's not the name.

00:00:41.922 --> 00:00:43.655
I just don't understand why our code names

00:00:43.655 --> 00:00:45.789
have to be Disney theme park rides.

00:00:45.789 --> 00:00:46.751
- Well, why not?

00:00:46.751 --> 00:00:48.750
- Yeah, everyone likes Disneyland.

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:52.408
- Not everyone, I don't like Disneyland.

00:00:52.408 --> 00:00:53.363
(gasps)

00:00:53.363 --> 00:00:54.573
- What, what?

00:00:54.573 --> 00:00:56.132
- Are you serious?

00:00:56.132 --> 00:00:58.530
- Yes, I mean I just don't get the appeal.

00:00:58.530 --> 00:00:59.087
- What?

00:00:59.087 --> 00:01:00.441
- Do you even have a heart?

00:01:00.441 --> 00:01:02.054
- Yes I have a heart.

00:01:02.054 --> 00:01:04.297
In all honesty, I've never
even been to Disneyland, so.

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:05.598
- What!?

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:07.975
- Okay, okay, hold on, hold on.

00:01:07.975 --> 00:01:10.035
How can you hate something
you've never even experienced?

00:01:10.035 --> 00:01:12.717
What, excuse me, Justin hates broccoli.

00:01:12.717 --> 00:01:14.261
Yet he's never had broccoli.

00:01:14.261 --> 00:01:15.891
- They look like little trees.

00:01:15.891 --> 00:01:17.362
I don't see how anybody eats them.

00:01:17.362 --> 00:01:18.911
- Okay yeah, but this is Disneyland.

00:01:18.911 --> 00:01:20.159
Disneyland's the best.

00:01:20.159 --> 00:01:21.081
- The best.

00:01:21.081 --> 00:01:22.402
- What makes it the best?

00:01:22.402 --> 00:01:23.011
- It's beautiful.

00:01:23.011 --> 00:01:23.783
- It's magical.

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:25.490
- The time stops when you're there.

00:01:25.490 --> 00:01:27.375
- You don't have a fret in this world.

00:01:27.375 --> 00:01:29.749
- Is the food reasonably priced?

00:01:29.749 --> 00:01:32.204
- Like honestly, I can justify spending

00:01:32.204 --> 00:01:34.804
11 dollars on a corn dog,
cause it's that good.

00:01:34.804 --> 00:01:37.039
- Okay, listen, I've seen the commercials

00:01:37.039 --> 00:01:38.754
it's too crowded, and I don't like that.

00:01:38.754 --> 00:01:40.440
- Okay it gets a little crowded,

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:43.346
but when you're there, it's
like we're one big happy family.

00:01:43.346 --> 00:01:44.906
- Sounds like trash.

00:01:44.906 --> 00:01:46.572
- You are a monster!

00:01:46.572 --> 00:01:47.852
- Oh my God!

00:01:47.852 --> 00:01:49.478
- Hey lady, do you like Disneyland?

00:01:49.478 --> 00:01:51.794
- What? Get out of my house,
I'm gonna call the police!

00:01:51.794 --> 00:01:53.114
- Answer the question!

00:01:53.114 --> 00:01:54.598
- Yeah, I mean, I like Disneyland,

00:01:54.598 --> 00:01:56.182
but don't kill me about it.

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:57.337
- See even she likes Disneyland.

00:01:57.337 --> 00:01:58.105
- [Homeowner] 911?

00:01:58.105 --> 00:02:01.172
- Okay, so she likes it, people like it,

00:02:01.172 --> 00:02:02.611
I don't like it, it's not for everybody.

00:02:02.611 --> 00:02:04.054
- You are crazy!

00:02:04.054 --> 00:02:05.051
- Hey,

00:02:05.051 --> 00:02:07.070
you keep your voice down, okay?

00:02:07.070 --> 00:02:09.205
We're professionals, you're on the job.

00:02:09.205 --> 00:02:10.412
- I am so sorry, you're right.

00:02:10.412 --> 00:02:13.724
- Hey, both of you, just listen.

00:02:13.724 --> 00:02:15.877
How about tomorrow,

00:02:15.877 --> 00:02:17.726
we take a little trip down to Disneyland?

00:02:17.726 --> 00:02:19.027
- Just make a day out of it.

00:02:19.027 --> 00:02:21.465
- Okay, okay I will try it,

00:02:21.465 --> 00:02:24.065
but if I don't like it,
then that's the end of this.

00:02:24.065 --> 00:02:25.792
- How about a group hug?

00:02:25.792 --> 00:02:27.864
Huh? I'm feeling a group hug, let's do it.

00:02:27.864 --> 00:02:29.205
- Let's go.

00:02:30.377 --> 00:02:31.360
- [Justin] This is nice.

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:32.506
- [Small World] Mhmm.

00:02:32.506 --> 00:02:34.416
(sirens)

00:02:34.416 --> 00:02:36.651
- [All] Ohhh.

00:02:36.651 --> 00:02:37.971
- I totally forgot we were in the middle

00:02:37.971 --> 00:02:39.942
of a robbery and just got caught.

00:02:39.942 --> 00:02:43.213
- Alright guys, Disneyland
in three to five years.

00:02:43.213 --> 00:02:45.067
- Disneyland in three to five years.

00:02:46.596 --> 00:02:49.112
(elated music)

00:02:49.112 --> 00:02:53.097
(techno music)

00:03:00.343 --> 00:03:01.109
(camera shutter)

00:03:01.109 --> 00:03:05.199
(pleasurable music)

